{
  "iri": "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_40303",
  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A fatty acid ester that is mevastatin carrying an additional methyl group on the carbobicyclic skeleton. It is used in as an anticholesteremic drug and has been found in fungal species such as <em>Aspergillus terreus</em> and <em>Pleurotus ostreatus</em> (oyster mushroom)."
  ],
